{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Companions is a &quot;cozy/life simulator&quot;, in which you are an astronaut traveling the vast and unknown universe to explore new worlds and befriending aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find new and strange worlds, land with your dropship, and explore alien vegetation and animal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Make first contact with aliens, be social if you want to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Get funds from earth for creating a cosmic community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use your funds for better engines that moves you quicker to the next planet, and more.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It\u00b4s a game designed not to be played in one go, so set a course for the next world. It can take hours to reach it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2101850?t=1754163503","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101850/6d1a2a53b9180109386df2a7681b7dec4cce27b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754163503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101850/5fa9bdbb3c249339c3ed2eaeb855902b4c346ff4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754163503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101850/5fa9bdbb3c249339c3ed2eaeb855902b4c346ff4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754163503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Companions is a &quot;cozy/life simulator&quot;, in which you are an astronaut traveling the vast and unknown universe to explore new worlds and befriending aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find new and strange worlds, land with your dropship, and explore alien vegetation and animal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Make first contact with aliens, be social if you want to.</p><p